{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22035","headline":"有木诗八首 六 · 白居易","name":"有木诗八首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有木名水柽，远望青童童。\n根株非劲挺，柯叶多蒙笼。\n彩翠色如柏，鳞皴皮似松。\n爲同松柏类，得列嘉树中。\n枝弱不胜雪，势高常惧风。\n雪压低还举，风吹西复东。\n柔芳甚杨柳，早落先梧桐。\n惟有一堪赏，中心无蠹虫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22035.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22035","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}